        img: "https://images.weedmaps.com/dispensaries/000/406/028/avatar/1773776180-copy_of_copy_of_copy_of_untitled_design.png",
        google: { rating: 4.7, review_count: 163, maps_url: 'https://maps.google.com/?cid=844772929472102350&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA', reviews: [{author: 'Jason Azizi', rating: 5, text: 'Every time I come there, they always treat me very good. It’s always a great time. I leave with great happiness knowing that I got some products to go relax and chill and have some fun. They they treat everybody the same. They’re really good dispensary. All the employees are just amazing and they do their job just right, I will come back here all the time, and I do 4-7 time a week and there really', time: '2 weeks ago'}, {author: 'COVID-Shark', rating: 3, text: 'The three stars are for the location and service. The store is very clean, nice layout, and it’s easy to find. The younger gal that helped me was very friendly, but knew little about the flower. I purchased some Flor flower and it was horrible. Not only was it smaller than popcorn size buds at other places, but it was so dry a humidor pack could bring it back. It was harsh and had no flavor. This ', time: '6 months ago'}, {author: 'Audrey B', rating: 3, text: 'Its pretty alright. The Pros: I love all the employees, they really are nice and fun to talk to. I mostly appreciate the simplicity of the shop and the menu.  The only thing I can say is that their menu is smaller compared to some of the other dispenseries right now.  They are also a little higher priced when it comes to prerolls and bud compared to other spots such as Green Goods and Rise, but di', time: '3 months ago'}, {author: 'Brianna Smith', rating: 5, text: 'I love it here, been my go to shop since I first discovered it. The women that work there are informative, kind, and super welcoming! The prices are not nearly as taxed as they are at places like rise. Plus the fact that it’s women owned…. Such a plus ☺️', time: '2 months ago'}, {author: 'Aaron Stransky', rating: 5, text: 'Very knowledgeable about their products. Employees can suggest items if you are unsure about what you are looking for. Good price and selection. I have made repeat visits!', time: 'a month ago'}] }
