        google: { rating: 4.6, review_count: 57, maps_url: 'https://maps.google.com/?cid=14608129827150138752&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA', reviews: [{author: 'Ashley Money', rating: 5, text: '⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️ MN Roots has the friendliest budtenders! Everyone is welcoming and happy to help you find what you’re looking for. They have such a great variety—from delicious drinks and gummies to treats for your pup! Love having a place with so many options and such a friendly crew. Highly recommend checking them out!', time: '4 weeks ago'}, {author: 'King Mike', rating: 5, text: 'Staff was very knowledgeable about the products sold and were overall just great to talk to.  If its your first time in or your a seasoned vet with a refined palette,  they got you', time: '3 months ago'}, {author: 'Brownsville Girl', rating: 1, text: 'I am very disappointed in MnRoots Dispensary.  I stopped in a couple of weeks ago.  One of the things I purchased was a GrasslandZ 1G disposable, rechargeable vape that I paid $56 for.  At home that night, I did try it and it worked fine.  A couple of days later I left and was on vacation for two weeks.  That night I tried it and it was dead.  I put it on the charger until the next day.  When I pu', time: '4 months ago'}, {author: 'Luke McCapes', rating: 5, text: 'Amazing layout, variety, and product! Staff is friendly and knowledgeable. This is a great place for a new "Space Adventurer" to learn, or an "Established Galaxy Travelor" to find resources to bring them to their next planet. Don\'t let this rural location fool you, they have the goods in the woods!', time: '2 years ago'}, {author: 'Curtis White', rating: 5, text: 'Best Educators of Cannabis in the state of MN. Great products, great people and great stores. Super helpful in every aspect of the cannabis experience. Very pleased with the Mn Roots products and staff would refer them to anybody. This place is best dispensary in the state that ive personally been too.', time: '6 months ago'}] }
