        img: "https://images.weedmaps.com/dispensaries/000/406/707/avatar/1779404029-7775e79d-a626-4d93-a775-cd2fb52954ee.PNG",
        google: { rating: 4.1, review_count: 62, maps_url: 'https://maps.google.com/?cid=4807855919563758862&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA', reviews: [{author: 'Stephen Eigenmann', rating: 5, text: 'Friendly staff with a great selection of hemp and cannabis products. The store initially launched with farm bill compliant hemp products, but since cultivation has come online they carry a number of strains and Minnesota cannabis products. The store is locally owned and owner operated. Give them a chance the next time you’re in the Duluth area.', time: '2 months ago'}, {author: 'Jennifer Bakken', rating: 5, text: 'For a small and new business they offered a good variety, and were well prepared for questions with well thought out answers.  The business is in a clean and safe area, and the business is owned by women who are delightful.  As someone who suffers from chronic pain, I refuse to be sucked into treatment via opioids, cannabis is a much safer and not addictive alternative!  I’ll be back!', time: '4 months ago'}, {author: 'Manda', rating: 5, text: 'It was a cute and quaint little shop. They had a decent selection and the staff was great! The woman who helped us was really sweet and very knowledgeable.', time: '2 months ago'}, {author: 'Christine Althaus', rating: 5, text: 'First off—the store decor is adorbs! Stop just for that and then chat with the helpful and friendly staff. They’re very knowledgeable and can help you make the perfect purchase!', time: '4 months ago'}, {author: 'Alex Polstner', rating: 5, text: 'Soo glad I found this place. The owner went above and beyond, the selection is great. Great vibes. I will be back for merch!', time: 'a month ago'}] }
