        google: { rating: 4.3, review_count: 19, maps_url: 'https://maps.google.com/?cid=5319518250122934986&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA', reviews: [{author: 'Beau Farrell', rating: 5, text: 'Nice spot inside the mall!  Good info from the budtenders', time: '3 weeks ago'}, {author: 'Brittany Brown', rating: 5, text: 'Love Loonatixz Genetics 💚✨💚 Angel and the crew are so passionate about cannabis and bringing high quality hand crafted products to the community. I love seeing a family owned business bringing the heat 🔥😏 The Grape Aliens is phenomenal! For the people bashing hours, again, small family operated businesses that is literally doing it all from seed to shelf. Look at hours online and call ahead instea', time: '2 months ago'}, {author: 'Destinee Butler', rating: 5, text: '​The owner goes above and beyond in every single detail, making you feel completely valued from the moment you connect with them. You aren\'t just getting top-tier service—you’re experiencing genuine dedication, care, and guidance from someone who truly loves what they do. ​The quality in product and knowledge—and the sheer privilege of having a small business like this in the Grand Rapids area—is ', time: '2 months ago'}, {author: 'William “Paris” Howard', rating: 5, text: 'You can feel the quality in the buds. The owners are fair and give more than they need to sometimes. So I always come here. The drinks have adaptogens with THC so it\'s actually pretty balancing. It\'s a great combo if your tolerance is high.', time: 'a month ago'}, {author: 'James LaPitz', rating: 5, text: 'Stopped in there yesterday. The staff was very knowledgeable and friendly. The product was very delicious too. Thank you.', time: '3 months ago'}] }
