        google: { rating: 4.6, review_count: 47, maps_url: 'https://maps.google.com/?cid=12357543422035386426&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA', reviews: [{author: 'Colby McKay', rating: 5, text: 'Cassidy is the absolute coolest owner and the shop is definitely worth checking out! Left with some delicious angry apple prerolls and a stellar infused cream soda. 10/10 will be coming back again!', time: 'a month ago'}, {author: 'Matthew Shea', rating: 5, text: 'I visited for the first time yesterday, May 16th. Very cool location for a business, the store was very clean and organized as well. The lady that helped me was kind and very helpful. She informed me about their rewards program and its a great idea. You earn points with your purchases that you can eventually redeem for various accessories and swag. She also set me up with a punch card which I thin', time: '6 months ago'}, {author: 'Alicia McDonough', rating: 5, text: 'Living in Silver Bay, it’s been great having Two Harbors Cannabis close by. When they got flower, everything changed! Grateful for the quality flower I have received. They also started a points system like Chuck E. Cheese, where you can redeem them for goodies on the back wall. I’ve only encounter two employees, but they are both superb, friendly and very helpful. Thank you so much for bringing fl', time: '5 months ago'}, {author: 'Butterfly Wine', rating: 2, text: 'I hate to say this because I’m usually a huge fan, come once a week, but I just had a pretty bad experience. The guy behind the counter was pretty rude so be cautious coming here. However if you see an older gentleman he’s the most helpful man I’ve met.', time: '4 months ago'}, {author: 'Sandor Karacsony', rating: 5, text: 'Lovely store with a knowledgeable, friendly, and genuinely helpful team. They took the time to answer questions without any pressure. Highly recommended.', time: '3 months ago'}] }
