        google: { rating: 4.7, review_count: 125, maps_url: 'https://maps.google.com/?cid=11438091904175603222&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA', reviews: [{author: 'Brian Wene', rating: 5, text: 'Great shop with regular deals on beverages and dummies. The interior is comfortable with big windows allowing sunlight to create a warm atmosphere. Usually there are nice deals on beverages as well as consistently low prices on other items such as gummies and merch. If you have any questions the staff are eager to assist with your visit. I am guilty of chatting with the employees. Thank you for ma', time: 'a month ago'}, {author: 'Matt DeHart', rating: 5, text: 'As a regular customer I’m always happy with my purchases and tend to leave with a smile on my face due to how personable and professional the staff is. The product is great, the atmosphere is great, and the employees are great. What are you waiting for? Get your butts there so you can get your buds there.', time: '2 months ago'}, {author: 'Robin Heil', rating: 5, text: 'The folks here always greet me with a smile. Grace always has a nice vibe. They have a few standard products along with a rotating selection from multiple growers. They have a basic rewards program. They also have accessories like pipes, lighters, and butane fuel. I just wish they sold pipe cleaners!', time: 'a month ago'}, {author: 'Lucky Elliott-Black', rating: 5, text: 'Absolutely fantastic service and selection. They carry flower, drinks, tinctures, and more. The staff is very knowledgeable and super friendly but will also give you space if you\'re just perusing.', time: '2 months ago'}, {author: 'Travis Frakes', rating: 5, text: 'Wildflower was able to get me exactly what I wanted in regards to flower and rolling papers. Grace was very helpful with determining what I needed from their selection. Pleased with the experience.', time: '2 months ago'}] }
