        gradient: 'linear-gradient(135deg, #4338ca, #7c3aed)',
        initial: 'LC',
        img: "https://images.weedmaps.com/dispensaries/000/403/049/avatar/1775614838-mpls-wm-logo.png",
        google: { rating: 4.6, review_count: 125, maps_url: 'https://maps.google.com/?cid=2549655575304561888&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA', reviews: [{author: 'Deshann Sanchez', rating: 5, text: 'With so many new spots opening up around the Twin Cities- it’s been hard to find good quality products at consistent & reasonable prices. Legacy Cannabis has been a solid source! On top of the good stuff and prices- what keeps me coming back is also the customer service & friendly folx behind the counter. Shout out to Court, Queen and Ben for being awesome humans & keeping us coming back! 10/10 re', time: 'a month ago'}, {author: 'Emily Swanson', rating: 5, text: 'Great selection. I liked the physical menu I could hold. Queen was so helpful. She helped my friend and I that had totally different questions. She was awesome! Cool location too. Art quality glass shop next door. We’ll be back.', time: '5 months ago'}, {author: 'Derek Perez', rating: 2, text: 'Definitely, not the best dispensary in Minnesota. They mislabeled the menu saying that the lit og was 27% percent. I took a look at my bag when I got on the car.It says 24.3%. I went back to see if I can return it since I didn\'t even open the bag yet. They just said since I left the building, I can\'t exchange it or return it. Even though the product was mislabeled Funny thing is, they didn\'t even ', time: '4 months ago'}, {author: 'Tyler Hameister', rating: 5, text: 'Have always loved Legacy and Josh is one of the realest in the industry. Great selection. Great staff. Much love! #HeadintheTrees', time: '2 months ago'}, {author: 'Devon Lemon', rating: 5, text: 'Kendall and Sam gave amazing customer service . You can tell they care about their customers and strive to give the best service and made sure we left satisfied. Especially Kendall he was very knowledgeable and gave fantastic recommendations and really took the time to make sure we got what we wanted.', time: 'a month ago'}] }
