        img: "https://images.weedmaps.com/dispensaries/000/386/867/avatar/1762796325-weedmaps_logo.jpg",
        google: { rating: 4.9, review_count: 596, maps_url: 'https://maps.google.com/?cid=497623207070150284&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA', reviews: [{author: 'Evan King', rating: 5, text: 'Absolutely one of the best dispensaries I\'ve visited! From the moment I walked in, the staff made me feel welcome and took the time to answer all of my questions without rushing me. Their knowledge of the products was impressive, and they helped me find exactly what I was looking for. The selection is outstanding, with high-quality flower, concentrates, edibles, and more at fair prices. The store ', time: '3 months ago'}, {author: 'Hayley Ortwein', rating: 5, text: 'Extremely kind service workers, very knowledgeable and helpful. Every single person was considerate and communicative.  I think they said they are adding a medical component soon as well with licensing. Very clean well kept store.  Prices were decent pretty standard. I was able to get a decent deal on some disposables.  Lots of sales going on for all different products edibles inhalants etc.  Defi', time: '2 months ago'}, {author: 'Ana', rating: 5, text: 'Very friendly and helpful staff always willing to answer questions and offer suggestions. Amazing quality and variety of strains for flower, you can see and smell! Lots of other options for non smoking consumption as well. I HIGHLY recommend you check it out :)', time: 'a week ago'}, {author: 'Bridget Johnson', rating: 5, text: 'Love this place. Been here twice. Pete was very helpful and knowledgeable. There’s lots to choose from and the prices of everything is reasonable compared to other places I’ve checked out in the area. They also have sales which is super nice. Definitely recommend this place. Will keep coming back!', time: 'a month ago'}, {author: 'Alexa Schnarr', rating: 5, text: 'The service is here is amazing! The employees are super kind and helpful with choosing products. Pete was also very kind and threw in a free lighter for me after my purchase! Super appreciative and will definitely be coming back.', time: 'a month ago'}] }
