        google: { rating: 4.6, review_count: 220, maps_url: 'https://maps.google.com/?cid=2343509097665817343&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA', reviews: [{author: 'erik Turner', rating: 5, text: 'Stopped into Fridley Dispensary looking for something new and ended up getting recommended Super Boof by one of the staff members. Absolute awesome recommendation. The budtender didn’t just point me toward the “highest THC” option — they actually asked what I was specifically looking to achieve. You can tell the staff here actually uses and understands cannabis instead of reading off labels.  Supe', time: '6 months ago'}, {author: 'oswaldo Merel', rating: 1, text: 'I usually buy from them and the service is good, the products are good, but this time I don\'t recommend it. I bought two 2g vapes, and one came with resin that tasted burnt, like when it\'s empty. The other one leaks resin from the top, and instead of helping me, they told me I have to contact the supplier for an exchange, which is ridiculous. I bought it from the supplier, and honestly, I don\'t re', time: 'a week ago'}, {author: 'Sara Ehrenberg', rating: 5, text: 'Super friendly, knowledgeable and helpful staff!! Everything felt super chill, there was no pressure to buy anything, though I did. I would definitely go back and I’m excited to try new things from this dispensary.', time: '2 weeks ago'}, {author: 'Douglas Arnold', rating: 5, text: 'What more can I say, Great Service, Great Selection. I always feel welcome!!!! Oden is awesome!', time: '2 months ago'}, {author: 'Luann Z', rating: 5, text: 'It’s like coming home to Norms Bar. lol. They remember me and I only stop in once every couple of weeks.  They are knowledgeable and take the time to help me. I’m kind of ignorant about their products, but they’re willing to recommend the best for my health. Thanks kids!!!', time: 'a month ago'}] }
