        google: { rating: 4.6, review_count: 2195, maps_url: 'https://maps.google.com/?cid=10091604970785504202&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA', reviews: [{author: 'Rue Noriega', rating: 5, text: 'I stopped by RISE Cannabis about 10 minutes before closing, and honestly, I was impressed by how welcoming and relaxed the staff were. There were quite a few people pulling up last minute, but nobody seemed rushed, annoyed, or like they were ready to rush everyone out the door. Everyone was patient, friendly, and helpful. The flower was fresh, they have daily deals, and they offer a veterans disco', time: '2 months ago'}, {author: 'Jessica Ford', rating: 5, text: 'Tammy, Max, and Sophia are wonderful! Everyone is amazing, but today I had the pleasure of being helped by them. So nice and knowledgeable. I really appreciate every time I go to Rise I will get top notch service and knowledge of the products. Rise St Paul location is the best! You can’t go wrong with the St Paul location they truly are the best at what they do. Thank you Rise for always treating ', time: '3 months ago'}, {author: 'Timothy Murtaugh', rating: 1, text: 'I went back after my first order was messed up and I wasn’t given what I specifically asked for. Customer service was initially very nice about it and gave me a $20 credit, so I appreciated that.  Unfortunately, when I returned today, the same employee who messed up my original order was extremely rude and told me I didn’t have a credit. Eventually, some other employees helped me, but only after I', time: '2 months ago'}, {author: 'Megan Grill', rating: 5, text: 'I previously left a poor review from a phone call frustration. I was at Rise today with a concern about a vape. Tara was super nice about it and helped me with my order too. I actually deleted my old review while I was checking out with her. I admittedly could have been more patient and understanding. With that being said, I’m updating my review to accurately reflect 5 stars.', time: 'a month ago'}, {author: 'Autumn Mattfeld', rating: 5, text: 'This location is such a wonderful and clean environment. I always look forward to picking up my orders, the staff always make me feel so welcomed and are just some of the sweetest people! Special shoutout to Pearl, I look forward to seeing her every time I go, she almost always makes my day! Thank you all for being such balls of sunshine and pleasant to deal with! I recommend everyone check out th', time: '3 months ago'}] }
