        google: { rating: 4.2, review_count: 213, maps_url: 'https://maps.google.com/?cid=6765514405281286692&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA', reviews: [{author: 'Chnice Watson', rating: 5, text: 'Malik was amazing! He was friendly, knowledgeable, and provided excellent customer service. He took the time to answer all my questions and made sure I had a great experience. You can definitely tell he cares about his customers. I really appreciated his positive attitude and professionalism. I’ll definitely be back—ask for Malik when you stop by Legacy Cannabis! 🙌🏽', time: '2 months ago'}, {author: 'Tim A', rating: 1, text: 'Minnesota prices are insane.. no rewards no goodies for being first time shoppers… pre packed so you cant see exactly what ur buying… i think they need to learn a thing or two from michigan.. great place to go if you enjoy being ripped off on prices… i wont step foot in a Minnesota dispensary ever again unless they can figure out the prices… so sad to see everyone taking there money out of Minneso', time: '3 weeks ago'}, {author: 'Kai Haase', rating: 5, text: 'I love stopping by Legacy! Everyone is so friendly and very knowledgeable. I especially appreciate Melanie’s insight— They always help make deciding between so many options less overwhelming. I can tell they’re very passionate about it and I appreciate the joy they bring! I also love how honest they are about what is in store and what to look forward to, if there’s something specific I ask about.', time: '6 months ago'}, {author: 'Shawn Christopherson', rating: 5, text: 'Maleek and Jules (hope I got the names correct) were very welcoming, informative and helpful and getting me what I need. Amazing service can\'t wait to try my Frankenstein product!', time: '3 months ago'}, {author: 'Dylan Fisher', rating: 5, text: 'Great atmosphere as well as knowledgeable staff make this a frontier location for this budding new business in D-Town. Lacy was not only helpful but also seemed to be particularly enthusiastic with assisting me with any suggestions or questions I had in mind. Glad to see MN is getting on track with the times, catching up to pace with several other states, and providing employment via places like L', time: '5 months ago'}] }
