        img: "https://images.weedmaps.com/dispensaries/000/388/581/avatar/1770743314-ll_hk_wm_logo_.png",
        google: { rating: 4.2, review_count: 78, maps_url: 'https://maps.google.com/?cid=11331542417030810410&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA', reviews: [{author: 'Travis', rating: 4, text: 'Awesome experience. Stopped in there like 8 minutes before they closed. Both guys who helped me out were very knowledgeable & friendly, not upset at someone coming in right before close. Small shop with small selection is only negative. The disposable vape I got is one of the best disposable’s I’ve ever had.', time: '2 months ago'}, {author: 'Matt Wilkie', rating: 1, text: '41 yrs old and they turned me down because my ID was expired.   What is the ID used for except to verify age?  I was obviously old enough.  Front door guy seemed to enjoy turning me down.  Will not be back', time: '4 weeks ago'}, {author: 'Tyler', rating: 5, text: 'Fantastic location, reasonable prices, and excellent staff. I visited once in the past during their grand opening, glad I visited again.  I reccomend the strain "Purple Milk," I haven\'t seen it anywhere else. The feeling is a nice fun giggly high. Flavor isn\'t intensely skunk, and hits very smooth.', time: '5 months ago'}, {author: 'Bob', rating: 1, text: 'Bought 2 - 4 gram bags.  Pictured is what was in the first one I opened. The second appeared correct. The first one had maybe .1 grams. Went back in the following day.  They said all sales are final no refunds. They did offer points to use towards my next purchase. Valued at less than half the value of the original bag. I said, so I\'m supposed to open the bag in here next time, they said yes. So t', time: '5 months ago'}, {author: 'Alex Busch', rating: 5, text: 'We love Lake Leaf! Incredibly kind, knowledgeable individuals in every step of the experience. Great quality, WAY BETTER prices than Rise or others. Worth the drive every time. We often pre-order and just run in to pick up. 11/10 best dispo prices and % in the state and I have visited nearly all!!', time: '7 months ago'}] }
