        initial: 'HD',
        img: "https://images.weedmaps.com/dispensaries/000/402/232/avatar/1780701299-grazzhopper_logo_copy.png",
        google: { rating: 4.4, review_count: 199, maps_url: 'https://maps.google.com/?cid=2935261737347043840&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA', reviews: [{author: 'Nood Llee', rating: 5, text: 'This place is THE spot to go! The people are kind. They aren’t trying to get through their days, they are simply trying to make your experience better in all ways. And I have experienced that so this is a 5 star deal I think. There’s understanding and workers who just make you feel like your not just in in out. They will take time to learn your name and no other place has done that for me so yay !', time: '3 weeks ago'}, {author: 'm p', rating: 5, text: 'Stopped by last week for a couple pre rolls and the ladies was real helpful and the vybz were as if we was friends. I recommend this shop.The orange THC drink was good too. My new go to place.', time: '9 months ago'}, {author: 'Bill Gardner', rating: 5, text: 'I just recently started going to this store and have had nothing but great things to say about the staff and selection of products.  The staff is always friendly and knowledgeable and willing to help find what best fits your needs. The only place I go.', time: '4 weeks ago'}, {author: 'T Winz', rating: 5, text: 'Great experience for a first time visitor.  Employees were very helpful and prices were decent.  Large selection of flower, gummies and paraphernalia!!! I\'ll definitely be going back.!!!!!!', time: 'a month ago'}, {author: 'Scott Zaccagnini', rating: 5, text: 'First time in this spot and it did not disappoint! Great service, clean/professional setup, and a great variety of goods. Much better than some Chicago dispensaries. Happy to see the inaugural hometown dispensary get it right the first time. ✊🏽', time: '7 months ago'}] }
