        gradient: 'linear-gradient(135deg, #166534, #22c55e)',
        initial: 'IP',
        img: "https://images.weedmaps.com/dispensaries/000/362/874/avatar/1765913316-untitled_design__17_.png",
        google: { rating: 4, review_count: 886, maps_url: 'https://maps.google.com/?cid=14008776347581454884&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA', reviews: [{author: 'Emma Begalka', rating: 5, text: 'I have visited twice now from the cities area (just under an hour drive each way) and I absolutely will again. Feels just like dispensaries in other legal states. Prices are decent, selection is decent, the employees are knowledgeable and make it easy to find what you’re looking for. It seems like a lot of the negative reviews are from a couple years ago when supplies were very limited and the bus', time: 'a year ago'}, {author: 'Colin Erickson', rating: 4, text: 'They are slowly improving the keif coated pre rolls are pretty good by lakeside, have not tried the wax or edibles yet.  I did try a cart it was okay... the flower is hit or miss but they do get good flower in Lemon cherry Gelato,  and Gumbo! just have to know what you are looking for to be honest and keep up with what they have in stock.  Store is always clean staff are decent Brittany is by far ', time: 'a year ago'}, {author: 'christopher Moeller', rating: 1, text: 'Cash ONLY, sometimes sold out of flower completely, way WAY TOO EXPENSIVE! Only dispensary I’ve been to that holds a flame with this place’s prices is in Edina! And they didn’t have to “Speakeasy” me either 😆. You’ll understand if you ever have to go into the Pezi 😆🥳', time: 'a month ago'}, {author: 'Skyler Blake', rating: 4, text: 'We are regulars, have tried many of the carts. Grasslandz appears to be the best, HOWEVER the manufacturer changed the type of cart the product comes in. The plastic white tips are a major flaw when it comes to using the product. Often times they clog or you are left waiting extended periods for the product to hit the heating element and you aren’t able to heat them due to it being plastic. Extrem', time: '3 months ago'}, {author: 'Jay Swap', rating: 3, text: 'Ive been here 4 times so far. The carts, specifically grasslandz are really good! However I bought 2 grams of lakeside wax. This is how it came. I could barely get the container open cause the wax melted and seeped around the container. And also after scraping it to get it off wasnt proper weight. I lost product because of it. Definitely do not recommend buying wax from this place.', time: '10 months ago'}] }
