        google: { rating: 4.7, review_count: 989, maps_url: 'https://maps.google.com/?cid=17509242439144634722&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA', reviews: [{author: 'Mar', rating: 5, text: '03/29/26 Edit: [see photo] Purchased Blue Waaboz and White Truffle today. The buds were nice and big, perfectly dried and they packed a punch!! 🤪💚  But I was impressed with the new packaging. The glass jars are great and the new round humidity pack that’s hidden under the cap is a major plus!! Nice 👍🏼I won’t be in a rush to put them in a mason jar.  11/23/26 Double points was the motivation that g', time: '7 months ago'}, {author: 'Dominick DeIeso', rating: 5, text: 'Awesome workers/budrenders. Super knowledgeable and friendly with some bomb ass kush. Shout out to Korbin for being an absolute beauty and helping a brother out. Can’t recommend this place enough no other dispo compares', time: '2 months ago'}, {author: 'Alan Roberts', rating: 5, text: 'Really love the place, love the vibes and what you\'re doing keep up the great work. As a consumer I have a question, when is st cloud store going to start seeing better quality flowers? The percentages have been super low lately and in my opinion not worth the price anymore when the quality was nearly double.', time: '5 months ago'}, {author: 'Desiré Bogenreif', rating: 5, text: 'They guys are the real deal! The shiz nit seriously! They always hook me up, they\'re funny as heck! Super sweet and extremely helpful and let me tell you their smoke NEVER disappoints! Highly recommend! Stay high friends!🩷✨️💨🍃', time: '3 months ago'}, {author: 'Euric Ards', rating: 5, text: 'Shay shay me a good time I think this was a good experience I haven\'t tested this yet so I\'m going to leave a question mark but the service went well.', time: 'a month ago'}] }
