        initial: 'GG',
        img: null,
        google: { rating: 4.5, review_count: 891, maps_url: 'https://maps.google.com/?cid=14384096910807857338&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA', reviews: [{author: 'Brianna Ward', rating: 5, text: 'I absolutely adore the store I come up a lot for appointments from Southwestern Minnesota and if I need anything when I\'m in the area this is always my go-to spot for sure the product\'s amazing the people are helpful and friendly the prices are good and I love all the merchandise I will always keep coming back', time: 'in the last week'}, {author: 'Mary A.', rating: 5, text: 'As a medical client, I am exceptionally pleased with the Green Goods (Bloomington) pharmacist, customer service and product offerings. Online ordering and appointment setting is streamlined and the communication about orders is stellar. Highly recommend!', time: 'a month ago'}, {author: 'Aaron Montreuil', rating: 5, text: 'I have Had A few Hiccups with Products in the early stages and they were more than happy to Fix any and all problems.  A quality issue I had, they Corrected with no resistance. Just some Photos of the Issue and we got it resolved.  Very pleased', time: '2 months ago'}, {author: 'James Mark', rating: 4, text: 'It is OK, I appreciate the location in Bloomington, the staff is generally good, knowledgeable, and helpful, sometimes, not often, sometimes people forget about the human element of customer service, and they skip steps, cut corners, and end up making one feel like it’s just another bureaucracy, but I am pleasantly pleased when the customer service you’d expect for someplace that focuses on health', time: '3 weeks ago'}, {author: 'Kiara Brown', rating: 5, text: 'the staff at this establishment is extremely knowledgeable and friendly about the products they carry. Green goods has exceptional medical cannabis products for the consumers who need a little more than just the highest THC. Terpenes and specific formulas truly make this the place to shop for all your cannabis needs!', time: 'a month ago'}] }
