        google: { rating: 4.4, review_count: 961, maps_url: 'https://maps.google.com/?cid=1526852106365911449&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA', reviews: [{author: 'Abel Urizar', rating: 1, text: 'I’ve been coming here as a med patient for 3 years now. Customer service has always been horrible here. I just called today just to get some clarification on their flower and i thought I was talking to my phone without a call being connected. Just quietness, a pause and then an answer as I was even stupid for asking. The staff at Rise are much more professional and friendly at the same time while ', time: '3 months ago'}, {author: 'Solo Bcuz', rating: 3, text: 'I\'ve been going here medically for a couple of years. They\'re nice people.  Good customer service.  Knowledgeable staff.  As far as the company.  Prices are kind of high.  Higher than most everyone else\'s. The product on sale,  is the throw away buds and product that will expire in a month.  Just hard little boogers rolling around. They need more and better deals. I spent $1,700 and my points rewa', time: '3 months ago'}, {author: 'Steven from MV', rating: 4, text: 'Know what? They\'re the best option, particularly medical patients. Rise spends all their money on those hipster adverts and promos. I lack the stupid tattoos required to pay more for no reason. I actually find sales here, just wish there were less bundle % markdowns. Those only benefit the guy with $500 to spend.', time: '2 weeks ago'}, {author: 'Greg Collins', rating: 5, text: 'Great store and products, but Valarie is the real reason to shop here. Knowledgeable, professional, and most importantly she is incredibly friendly! She is extremely helpful and makes visits to your store a better experience', time: '2 weeks ago'}, {author: 'Sharon Flor', rating: 2, text: 'Medical patients are suffering due to recreational users using up the stuff that helped. I\'m looking for RSO ANYWHERE.  The ONE THING that helped is ALWAYS out of stock since Rec opened.  Medical patients got shoved to the side. PROFIT seems to be what you care about most now. Its sad. I\'ve also received vapes that stopped working while still half full. The SIMPLE $110.00 vapes are always doing th', time: '7 months ago'}] }
