        google: { rating: 4.7, review_count: 486, maps_url: 'https://maps.google.com/?cid=18251015212855456438&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA', reviews: [{author: 'Sara Hadley', rating: 5, text: 'All I can say is wow! I was a little nervous because it was my first time buying on the Medical THC program. I was greeted by SA they were amazing. They were so friendly and welcoming. I was immediately less anxious and felt so welcome. As I was waiting in line I chatted with Kyla. She was so fun and kind. Again, I felt so comfortable and welcome. I was helped by Melissa at the medical counter. Sh', time: 'a month ago'}, {author: 'Average Joseph', rating: 4, text: 'Very pleasantly surprised by the quality. Went in for the first time today and had amazing help from two lovely women. Let me ask a few questions and understood my concerns coming from an amazing gray market. A hundred bucks for a quad isn\'t necessarily cheap, but if it\'s dank it\'s dank. And surprisingly its dank! Specifically the gmo pie and the grape mochi from vireo.  Edit: have to give four st', time: '2 months ago'}, {author: 'Premier Lifestyle Management', rating: 5, text: 'I wish Green Goods much success! I absolutely loved them! Over the course of our visit we tried other spots but none compared to the quality & vibes Green Goods got! The staff was AMAZING! Very welcoming. I 10/10 recommend Green Goods if you want the best!', time: '3 weeks ago'}, {author: 'Rachel Martineau', rating: 5, text: 'I absolutely love this place.  They have great deals. You can actually earn points to buy things.  Super friendly staff.  Great selection.   Very knowledgeable.', time: 'a month ago'}, {author: 'Chuck Simmons', rating: 2, text: 'Where\'s the product? My wife has been a medical patient since the beginning, and the vapes have been what has helped her pain, but no vapes for quite some time. Thank goodness we live PT in the cities and can go to RISE, where at least they take care of their medical patients by having vapes in stock. As the caregiver, I appreciate a company like RISE who values their medical customers, surely doe', time: 'a month ago'}] }
