        google: { rating: 4.4, review_count: 620, maps_url: 'https://maps.google.com/?cid=15753322763053639927&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA', reviews: [{author: 'A J', rating: 5, text: 'If your a medical patient then your going to want to check out Green Goods. Their selection and pricing are perfect for what I need to get by throughout the month. The staff is extremely friendly and helpful. Really recommend you trying this place out. And note you don’t need to be a medical patient to enter. They also offer adult use for recreational.', time: 'a month ago'}, {author: 'Heywood Jablome', rating: 1, text: 'Slowest dispensary in Moorhead. Why only 1 register open on Friday and Saturday evenings? It’s like this every single day. Every other dispensary in the area has multiple registers open at any time during the day. Do the other dispensaries pay better? Treat their employees better? Why does Green Good operate on a skeleton crew but other places have multiple employees to take care of the customers.', time: 'a month ago'}, {author: 'Tara Wieland', rating: 1, text: 'I am a daily medical cannabis patient and regular customer at this location. On August 19, I made a purchase around 6:00 PM and got home to find one pre-roll missing from my order. I called at 6:52 PM and spoke with management, who told me not to worry about bringing in the packaging — they\'d just credit my account $12 for it.  When I came in the next day to follow up, I was treated like the mista', time: '2 months ago'}, {author: 'John', rating: 4, text: 'Overall good, friendly staff, sometimes lines can be long but no more than 15 minutes wait, good flower but likely sold out of deal of the week by Friday afternoon. 😞 And bring cash, there\'s an extra charge for card payments. Its a nice minimalist store setting which is chill) with orders being filled behind the scenes, which is cool....no hub bub or hullabaloo to be experienced. A+ If I could get', time: '2 months ago'}, {author: 'Ryan Ratsey', rating: 5, text: 'Phenomenal great place only thing that I could say could be better would be the prices but it is what it is with that I appreciate the store or the workers are great and great clean place good environment positive vibes', time: 'a week ago'}] }
