        scores: { pricing: 76, selection: 82, service: 80, lab_testing: 85 },
        review_count: 690,
        verified: true,
        features: ["Medical + adult-use", "Statewide chain"],
        gradient: 'linear-gradient(135deg, #166534, #22c55e)',
        initial: 'RD',
        img: null,
        google: { rating: 4.8, review_count: 690, maps_url: 'https://maps.google.com/?cid=12002727602885414247&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA', reviews: [{author: 'Maxwell Goose', rating: 5, text: 'Paris was absolutely wonderful! She was incredibly kind, professional, and knowledgeable. She made sure all my questions were answered, offered helpful recommendations, and made the entire experience smooth and enjoyable. Her attention to detail and exceptional customer service really stood out. I felt comfortable throughout the entire process and never felt pressured or rushed. I would highly rec', time: '2 weeks ago'}, {author: 'Bluetuxgames', rating: 5, text: 'It was my first time in a dispensary and I kinda had no idea what I was doing, but Tessa was wonderful help she showed me how to do everything so big ups to her we need more people in dispensarys like this make for easy learning and definitely got a loyal customer now. Thanks again Tessa for all the help!😄', time: 'a month ago'}, {author: 'Justin Meyer', rating: 5, text: 'I went to Rise this evening.  Tessa was at the window and I know her and respect her professionally having worked with her previously. She has always been so pleasant and smiles so my experience was already worth it\'s own 5 star review. First time I walked in there that she was working she remembered me and it took me a while to remember how I know her and her name. Emma was at the counter and I d', time: 'a month ago'}, {author: 'Gui Lacerda', rating: 5, text: 'Tessa is absolutely wonderful! This was my first time visiting this store, and I couldn’t have been happier with the outstanding customer service she provided. She was quick to help me, incredibly friendly and welcoming, and her warm smile genuinely made my day. The service was fast, the store had a great variety of products available, and the entire experience exceeded my expectations. Thank you,', time: '2 months ago'}, {author: 'Kandus Cutrer', rating: 5, text: 'I love going into this place!! They have all been so absolutely amazing and kind! The flower and pens are always on point!  Tessa helped me out A lot this last time I was in! She held down it down by herself and communicated to those of us that were waiting. You got you a great one there!', time: '3 months ago'}] }
