        initial: 'FF',
        img: null,
        google: { rating: 4.6, review_count: 138, maps_url: 'https://maps.google.com/?cid=18107946376399637410&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA', reviews: [{author: 'Brandon', rating: 5, text: 'Wow! First off I have to compliment the esthetic of the whole place. Easy to find and a lot of variety for all your needs. Service was top notch and friendly, even when coming in a little bit closer to closing. Would 100% recommend (:', time: '3 months ago'}, {author: 'Top Notch Reviews', rating: 5, text: 'So as people who know/follow me, I am a MM patient and I have been for years now. So of course I already have the pleasure of tax free cannabis products. I am a frequent heavy user because I use for pain, sleep and I have cancer. That being said. I have a hard time getting concentrate. And it\'s pricey. So I purchased a 2g of the indica. I have the perfect set up for concentrate. So I been dabbing ', time: '6 months ago'}, {author: 'Brooke Clairmont', rating: 5, text: 'I came to visit family and seen this beautiful place as I was passing by, so of course I had to turn around and check it out. - The staff here are the best employees that I’ve ever encountered and are very knowledgeable. - A good variety of things to choose from. - The building is so beautifully designed, I spent some time just admiring even the smallest details. - The only small complaint that I ', time: '2 months ago'}, {author: 'TheLsk829', rating: 4, text: 'The most expensive cannabis I\'ve ever bought in my entire life. But the market is new. The building was nice, staff was incredible.', time: 'a week ago'}, {author: 'Mike T', rating: 5, text: 'Best products compared to other dispensaries and always super friendly and helpful staff. Best price and quality in MN.', time: 'a month ago'}] }
