        initial: 'IC',
        img: null,
        google: { rating: 4.9, review_count: 22, maps_url: 'https://maps.google.com/?cid=8656661228676046999&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA', reviews: [{author: 'Zachary', rating: 5, text: 'Great products with awesome discounts for neighborhood members. Was surprised they provide a discount just because I live nearby and work in the service industry. Really friendly staff, my third time and the discount continues! I will be back and great to see new products each time I come back. The other day I walked by and they had two live bands!! I took some photos lol', time: 'a month ago'}, {author: 'Jarrett Jackson', rating: 5, text: 'Store is a vibe! Great selection and affordable prices. The staff are very welcoming and knowledgeable as well. Will definitely be back', time: 'a month ago'}, {author: 'Nikki Hansen', rating: 5, text: 'Everyone was nice and there was a space right out front to park (thankfully- cuz the lot and the rest of the street were full (yet I was the only customer). From what I understand, they only have one strain for sale and only flower and only as 3.5g. The THC content is relatively low on this strain. $40 for the 3.5g (The deal was you get half off a joint if you buy 2 bags of flower but I declined.)', time: 'a month ago'}, {author: 'NRG', rating: 5, text: 'This is by far the coolest dispensary in the entire state and then some. There\'s so much artwork that the vibe gives art gallery meets dispensary. Honestly ,I just wanna get stoned and stare at the walls. Staff seems exceptionally kind, knowledgeable, and down to earth! Products are super dank & they have a lot of unique things I haven\'t seen before', time: 'a month ago'}, {author: 'David S', rating: 4, text: 'Friendly place and I appreciate small business. The part that didnt reslly impress me was the fact that I just spent $180 on an 8th and a 1/2 gram vape.. so make sure you got the cash to burn.', time: 'a month ago'}] }
