        initial: 'MC',
        img: null,
        google: { rating: 4.3, review_count: 54, maps_url: 'https://maps.google.com/?cid=4282644452727678295&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA', reviews: [{author: 'Virgil Cross', rating: 5, text: 'So cute! The gentleman running the store was a delightful conversationalist and the music was great. Eclectic decor and a very interesting selection- I\'m a tincture fan and they have things I haven\'t seen before! If the lights are on, they\'re open, and the parking lot in the back had plenty of space. I recommend!', time: 'a year ago'}, {author: 'Kat Peine', rating: 1, text: 'Scam and not open when they say they are. Don’t waste your time', time: '2 months ago'}, {author: 'D D', rating: 1, text: 'Everytime I go here the products are much higher than at other places. It’s apparent this place capitalizes off of extremely recreational customers who aren’t too knowledgeable on the market.  Place also tries way too hard to be some vibe den instead of a business. Also word on the street about this place isn’t great either. Just doesn’t seem like there’s much going for it tbh.', time: '8 months ago'}, {author: 'Nath', rating: 5, text: 'We came across this place by accident as we were checking Google for parking for Lover\'s Garden and found this spot! The vibes were immaculate, the store was So cute and eclectic and the worker/owner(?) was a delight to interact with and knowledgeable about the products! When the open signs and lights are on in the window, pop in!! Little lot in the back for easy parking to boot, which for Univers', time: 'a year ago'}, {author: 'Andrew', rating: 4, text: 'The gentleman was friendly and welcoming. The shop leans more toward a premium vibe and may appeal more to those with upscale tastes.', time: '8 months ago'}] }
