        img: null,
        google: { rating: 4.2, review_count: 133, maps_url: 'https://maps.google.com/?cid=4628562872597827814&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA', reviews: [{author: 'Myah Moen', rating: 5, text: 'So far so good! The maintenance and management team here have been so lovely and made our move in process as smooth as possible. First impression of this building have been really great. Quiet and CLEAN spaces. They are very communicative with updates and truly are available when we have needed them! Only have met friendly people living here so I think we chose the right move. ◡̈', time: '2 months ago'}, {author: 'Shirleen Christianson', rating: 5, text: 'Great tour! Beautiful property and location. You can certainly tell it just wasn’t a job for Nichole, but she truly cares about the property and I heard her call residents by name!', time: '3 months ago'}, {author: 'Bethany Kim', rating: 3, text: 'When I first moved here, it was very well kept and had a great staff. Location is convenient, but some concerns with previous break ins, theft, and crime. There has been high turnover with management in the last 3 years. Joe and Mark are efficient and reliable! Beautiful large windows and open concept, but the upkeep in cleanliness is poor. They haven’t scheduled window or patio cleaning in 2 year', time: '3 years ago'}, {author: 'Jen E', rating: 5, text: 'Beautiful property and the leasing agent Nichole is amazing! If you’re looking for a wonderful place to live where you’re treated like a person, not just a number check this place out!', time: '3 months ago'}, {author: 'Kaitlyn Ford', rating: 2, text: 'I loved my time at the McMillan. However, I’m disappointed with the exit process. Prior to exit, five star experience.  We recently moved out after three years and were surprised by a $217 cleaning fee and an additional $50 charge for door/floorboard damage. The manager said we would receive photos and we haven’t and it’s been two weeks. This was frustrating because we left the unit in excellent c', time: '2 months ago'}] }
