        initial: 'SF',
        img: null,
        google: { rating: 4.9, review_count: 232, maps_url: 'https://maps.google.com/?cid=16162380499076255393&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA', reviews: [{author: 'That1 Scrub', rating: 5, text: 'Great vibe of this place can\'t wait until the show room is open Love the people as well they always want to try and figure out what would be best for you personally Ash has helped me through figuring out my best selection', time: '7 months ago'}, {author: 'Creighton Engen', rating: 1, text: 'Stopped by at 5pm, nobody here but business hours sign reads 10a-8p. Intercom broken, masking tape on it says door is open. Door is locked.', time: '2 months ago'}, {author: 'Jared Bistodeau', rating: 5, text: 'This stores gummies & drinks are amazing. Being low sugar, vegan, and with a variety to pick from makes choosing difficult somedays, thankfully there is kind workers to help guide you! Excited for when the transition is over and the showroom gets to open until then very happy to have this store on my drive! Thanks for the help Cora!', time: '6 months ago'}, {author: 'Spencer Herrmann', rating: 5, text: 'Stopped by without a gameplan and Kacey was very helpful. Great knowledge and good time. Definitely going to be back.', time: 'a year ago'}, {author: 'hezanderson1', rating: 5, text: 'This store is great! Daryl is the best at customer service. Extremely knowledgeable and accomodates special orders. We have been going there for a couple of years now, and we are never disappointed. A great selection, and so much easier than the big dispensaries. Better prices as well!', time: '8 months ago'}] }
