        google: { rating: 4.7, review_count: 166, maps_url: 'https://maps.google.com/?cid=17419024291603902230&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA', reviews: [{author: 'John Daly', rating: 5, text: 'Best prices. Beat top competitor on $100 unit by $20 - expert knowledge from employees. They showed me they take care of customers when a product they sold ended up being faulty, and it’s not their fault nor my fault, they took care of me. They have the full variety of whatever I want, and its owner operated. The owner is clearly a connoisseur, every time I go in there’s new products I’ve never se', time: '2 months ago'}, {author: 'Andrew Wiebusch', rating: 5, text: 'I\'ve been shopping at twin cities cannabis since it opened, and I can\'t say enough good things about this place! Lovely, helpful, polite, generous, welcoming and very knowledgeable staff. I stopped going to places that feel more like a chain. This is a unique local shop with great prices and even a shop cat!', time: '2 months ago'}, {author: 'Lucas G', rating: 5, text: 'I\'ve been coming to Twin Cities Cannabis for a while now, and it\'s become my go-to shop. Their prices are consistently some of the most competitive I\'ve found anywhere in the Twin Cities, and I\'ll happily drive a little farther to stock up here.  It\'s also been really cool watching the store grow since I started coming in earlier this year. They\'ve steadily expanded their selection and clearly rei', time: '3 months ago'}, {author: 'Shane A', rating: 5, text: 'The only place I’ll shop. Best prices around, and the staff know what they’re talking about. I’ve been to other dispensaries and they talk about weed like they’re trying to cast a spell on you, I appreciate being treated to like a knowledgeable consumer rather than a 12 year old checking out leafly for the first time.', time: '2 weeks ago'}, {author: 'Matt Wilkie', rating: 5, text: 'This place is awesome!  Great products, and most importantly owners who care.  It was very obvious these guys knew what they were doing, and they are passionate about it.  My new go to spot  👌🏻', time: 'a month ago'}] }
