        google: { rating: 4.5, review_count: 1485, maps_url: 'https://maps.google.com/?cid=6125327960312944220&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA', reviews: [{author: 'Kevin Quinn', rating: 5, text: 'I’ve been a RISE customer for years, and while I’ve used other locations in the past, I couldn’t be happier with my experience at RISE Eagan.  One thing I’ve noticed is that the selection at Eagan seems to be more extensive than at some of the other RISE locations I’ve used, which I really appreciate. They also run some great sales and promotions for medical patients, making it even more worthwhil', time: 'a week ago'}, {author: 'Sammie Hardaway', rating: 5, text: 'PHENOMENAL experience at RISE in Eagan!! I genuinely cannot say enough good things about Sam and Bob. Especially as a medical patient, having people who are welcoming, knowledgeable, patient, and genuinely caring makes such a difference — and these two absolutely delivered. 🙌🏽💚  From the moment I walked in, the energy was AMAZING. Sam and Bob made me feel comfortable, respected, and taken care of,', time: '2 months ago'}, {author: 'Susan Nyberg Higgins', rating: 5, text: 'Great friendly staff and if in store the line moves quickly. Great selections of cannabis and reasonably priced along with other stores but,this one has a Sr. Discount also and a delivery for Medical users. The Delivery Drivers are on time and they update you if something comes up with the delivery. My drivers have been outstanding! They Communicate well and they are on time and very friendly! Ive', time: '3 months ago'}, {author: 'Erik Johannsen', rating: 5, text: '— An Outstanding Experience Every Time!  I cannot say enough wonderful things about RISE Dispensary in Eagan! Their consistency, professionalism, and genuine commitment to providing an exceptional customer experience are truly unmatched.  Their willingness to take the time to educate customers, answer questions, and thoroughly explain their products. You never feel rushed or like you’re just anoth', time: 'a week ago'}, {author: 'Oni Kirai', rating: 5, text: 'Great shop, decent prices for med card holders. Always fast service, operates like very well oiled machine  Only complaint is they have a terrible sativa flower selection. 1-2 options is not enough.', time: '5 months ago'}] }
