        img: "https://images.weedmaps.com/dispensaries/000/407/501/avatar/1777427033-fulllogo_nobuffer.png",
        google: { rating: 4.8, review_count: 45, maps_url: 'https://maps.google.com/?cid=5720171244352158203&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA', reviews: [{author: 'Amber Redd', rating: 5, text: 'Love their variety, and rotation of products! That is by far my favorite thing about this place. It\'s nice to see new inventory every time you enter a dispensary, verses the same old products that seemingly are in house staples at some of the others. A small, intimate space that offers a warm-welcoming, super cozy vibe! ☺️ Rather than that "hospital lobby" feel. Great customer service! Staff are a', time: 'in the last week'}, {author: 'Ceresdeath', rating: 5, text: 'Excellent selection of perroll joints at a good price too. Friendly customer service is available And they answers all your questions. Prices are nice not to expensive.', time: 'a week ago'}, {author: 'Cole Captain', rating: 5, text: 'A calm,  quiet little dispensary no bigger than your living room, you will surely feel at home while you shop. Great selection on bowls and pipes, and very knowledgeable about the products! Will be back', time: '5 months ago'}, {author: 'Luke Nadeau', rating: 5, text: 'Cozy store with a great vibe and friendly staff, prices are about average but you can catch some good deals if you keep an eye out. Will definitely be returning!', time: 'a month ago'}, {author: 'Jack Merriam', rating: 5, text: 'Very friendly staff. Every time I come in they are diligent in helping me find what I am looking. Nice store environment', time: '5 months ago'}] }
