        initial: 'GB',
        img: "https://images.weedmaps.com/dispensaries/000/406/475/avatar/1773964027-green_box.jpg",
        google: { rating: 4.1, review_count: 9, maps_url: 'https://maps.google.com/?cid=13660810402141738985&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA', reviews: [{author: 'Kevin Johnson', rating: 5, text: 'Yes the store is fairly sparse/empty... But they manufacture & sell their own product. I have been to other bigger shops and they all tend to have the Grasslands and other similar brands seen in the area. I specifically wanted to get away from those brands and decided to visit Green Box - I picked up Lemon Cherry Gelato (H) and the results are NOT disappointing.  Worth the stop 😀  Lower level park', time: '3 months ago'}, {author: 'Tub', rating: 5, text: 'The only dispensary in all Minnesota that meets the grade(quality on the dry and cured) in cannabis nugs(flower). All about the dry and cured in cannabis folks, nothing else. Every other dispensary in Minnesota, does not, I repeat, does not meet the standards in the final end consumer products(taking short cuts is a no-no). It is what it is folks.  Quality over quantity in medicine, ladies and gen', time: '4 months ago'}, {author: 'Matthew Gaughan', rating: 5, text: 'Finally a dispensary that has Flowers that actually provided me with a quality product that I can enjoy for a couple of hours after just a couple hits, why go to Rise, or green goods when there\'s green box dispensary in Lakeville MN off the frontage road on the bend in the road just after Kwik trip. The staff are pleasant and informative, pricing is compatible, quality is above the rest, check it ', time: '7 months ago'}, {author: 'Tim Standaert', rating: 1, text: 'The store is basically empty, and carry the same boof as the other dispensaries in MN.', time: '4 months ago'}, {author: 'Steve B', rating: 5, text: 'First store I’ve been to where you can see the product you are buying.  My new spot!!!', time: '7 months ago'}] }
